  "key_findings": [
    "F1: Jupiter MD (5 periods: DSH.V.001-005) \u2014 ALL NORMAL across all domains. Jupiter MD had no training events in any domain. Jupiter prior posteriors are purely prior-anchored for observation model. Implication: Jupiter MD predictions at M5-E rely entirely on prior specification.",
    "F2: Saturn MD (9 periods: DSH.V.006-014) \u2014 CAREER ELEVATED in 5/9 periods (55.6%): V.009, V.011, V.012, V.013, V.014. HEALTH ELEVATED in 2/9: V.007, V.013. RELATIONSHIP ELEVATED in 2/9: V.008, V.011. No SPIRITUAL or PSYCHOLOGICAL ELEVATED in Saturn MD. Saturn shows mixed but materially above-null CAREER activation.",
    "F3: Mercury MD (9 periods: DSH.V.015-023) \u2014 CAREER ELEVATED in 6/9 periods (66.7%): V.015, V.016, V.017, V.021, V.022, V.023. RELATIONSHIP ELEVATED in 4/9: V.015, V.016, V.021, V.022. HEALTH ELEVATED in 2/9: V.021, V.023. SPIRITUAL ELEVATED in 1/9: V.023. PSYCHOLOGICAL ELEVATED in 1/9: V.015. Mercury is the most domain-diverse activating MD.",
    "F4: DSH.V.015 (Mercury-Mercury, 2010-2013) \u2014 3 domains ELEVATED simultaneously (CAREER, RELATIONSHIP, PSYCHOLOGICAL). This is the only period with PSYCHOLOGICAL ELEVATED (n=1 training event: EVT.2012.09.XX.01). Peak multi-domain activation in the training corpus.",
    "F5: DSH.V.013 (Saturn-Rahu, 2004-2007) \u2014 2 domains ELEVATED (CAREER+HEALTH). Most event-dense period in Saturn MD (4 training events). Saturn-Rahu antardasha is classically associated with high-intensity multi-domain events.",
    "F6: DSH.V.021 (Mercury-Rahu, 2020-2022) \u2014 3 domains ELEVATED (CAREER+HEALTH+RELATIONSHIP). Held-out event EVT.2022.01.03.01 (twin daughters, RELATIONSHIP) falls here but was excluded from training. Training RELATIONSHIP events (EVT.2022.XX.XX.02) made the period RELATIONSHIP ELEVATED. The period is the most event-dense in Mercury MD (3 training events across 3 domains).",
    "F7: Periods DSH.V.018-020 (Mercury-Sun, Moon, Mars) are ALL NORMAL across all domains \u2014 yet 2 of the 3 held-out CAREER events fall here (EVT.2017.03.XX.01 in V.018, EVT.2019.05.XX.01 in V.020). This is consistent with the held-out blind protocol: the events were excluded from training, so these periods appear eventless and NORMAL. The model correctly predicted above-null CAREER probability for these periods based on Mercury MD signal alone.",
    "F8: SPIRITUAL domain has only 1 ELEVATED period in training (DSH.V.023: Mercury-Saturn). PSYCHOLOGICAL has only 1 (DSH.V.015: Mercury-Mercury). Both domains are prior-dominated (Beta(8,3) post_mean=0.727 comes from n=1 observation). Full calibration requires M5-E prospective data.",
    "F9: No SUPPRESSED periods appear in any domain across all 23 training periods. The suppressed threshold (MD prior P(ELEVATED)\u22640.22 AND no events) was never triggered. This confirms PRIOR_SPEC \u00a79 note: SUPPRESSED state retains pure prior Beta(0.5,9.5) across all domains. The suppressed observation model is entirely prior-anchored."
  ],
  "interpretation_note": "The timeline reveals a clear temporal activation arc: Jupiter MD (quiescent, 1984-2001 approximately), Saturn MD (career foundation with periodic multi-domain events), Mercury MD (most active, career-dominant with significant RELATIONSHIP co-activation). This aligns with classical Jyotish expectation: Mercury as 7L+10L produces the most career/relationship dual activation. The finding that CAREER is ELEVATED in 11/23 training periods (47.8%) \u2014 confirming the null model base rate computed in AC.M5D.3 \u2014 validates internal consistency between the timeline and the training data counts.",
  "dbn_params_ref": "06_LEARNING_LAYER/dbn/dbn_params_v1_0.json",
  "prior_spec_ref": "PRIOR_SPEC_v1_0.md v1.1 (NAP.M5.2 APPROVED FROZEN)"
}